tch, in possession, it looked more like a 3-3-4.","keys":["{T:home:sub} changes shape by phase: 3-4-3 with the ball, 3-3-3-1 without.","{T:away:sub} changes shape by phase: 3-3-4 with the ball, 3-4-3 without.","{T:home:pos} favourite lane: the right wing (22% of touches).","{T:home:sub} camped in the opponent's half: 31% of touches in the final third.","{T:away:pos} favourite lane: the centre (25% of touches)."],"impact":"Out of possession, {T:home:sub} defended higher (back line 28.0 m from goal, against 27.7 m; tournament average: 27.9 m). Defend high and win: the line held, and so did the gamble."}},"s3":{"fr":{"lead":"Le pressing, c'était {T:away:sub} : un PPDA de 10,0, contre 14,8 en face. Comprendre : moins de passes laissées à l'adversaire avant de lui sauter dessus.","keys":["Réaction à la perte : {T:away:sub} récupère 30 % de ses ballons perdus en moins de 5 s, contre 19 %. Une meute.","11 récupérations hautes pour {T:home:sub} (ballons perdus par l'adversaire dans ses 35 derniers mètres) : autant de départs d'actions à deux pas du but."],"impact":"Presser ne suffit pas : encore faut-il que les ballons récupérés se transforment. Ici, ils ne l'ont pas fait."},"en":{"lead":"The pressing came from {T:away:sub}: a PPDA of 10.0, against 14.8 for the opponents. Translation: fewer passes allowed before jumping on the ball.","keys":["Reaction to losing it: {T:away:sub} win back 30% of lost balls within 5 s, against 19%. A pack.","11 high regains for {T:home:sub} (balls lost by the opponent in their own 35 metres): that many attacks starting next to goal."],"impact":"Pressing is not enough: the regained balls still have to turn into something. Here, they did not."}},"s4":{"fr":{"lead":"Deux équipes proches sur l'axe (+0,76 et +0,95) : pas de choc de styles, plutôt un duel de mêmes recettes.","keys":["{T:home:Sub} : 63 % de passes courtes (moins de 15 m), contre 54 % en moyenne.","Le carrefour du réseau {T:home:de} : Granit Xhaka, impliqué dans 111 passes entre titulaires.","{T:away:Sub} : 62 % de passes courtes (moins de 15 m), contre 54 % en moyenne.","Le carrefour du réseau {T:away:de} : Caglar Söyüncü, impliqué dans 101 passes entre titulaires."],"impact":"À style égal, c'est l'exécution qui tranche : avantage {T:home:bare}."},"en":{"lead":"Two teams close on the axis (+0.76 and +0.95): no clash of styles, more of a mirror match.","keys":["{T:home:sub}: 63% short passes (under 15 m), against 54% on average.","The hub of {T:home:pos} network: Granit Xhaka, involved in 111 passes between starters.","{T:away:sub}: 62% short passes (under 15 m), against 54% on average.","The hub of {T:away:pos} network: Caglar Söyüncü, involved in 101 passes between starters."],"impact":"With similar styles, execution decides: advantage {T:home:sub}."}},"s5":{"fr":{"lead":"Perdre le ballon coûtait plus cher à {T:away:sub} : 4 tirs adverses en transition (0,57 xG), contre 2 pour l'autre camp.","keys":["{T:home:Sub} : 4,5 joueurs derrière le ballon à la perte, 4,7 quelques secondes plus tard ; bloc reformé (7 joueurs ou plus) dans 32 % des cas.","{T:away:Sub} : 4,7 joueurs derrière le ballon à la perte, 4,5 quelques secondes plus tard ; bloc reformé (7 joueurs ou plus) dans 19 % des cas."],"impact":"Le match s'est en partie joué là : mieux gérer ses pertes, c'est souvent mieux gérer le score."},"en":{"lead":"Losing the ball cost {T:away:sub} more: 4 opponent shots in transition (0.57 xG), against 2 the other way.","keys":["{T:home:sub}: 4.5 players behind the ball at the loss, 4.7 a few seconds later; block rebuilt (7+ players) in 32% of cases.","{T:away:sub}: 4.7 players behind the ball at the loss, 4.5 a few seconds later; block rebuilt (7+ players) in 19% of cases."],"impact":"Part of the match was decided right there: managing your losses is often managing the scoreline."}},"s6":{"fr":{"lead":"Hakan Çalhanoğlu avait un fan-club, et il portait le maillot adverse : 1,13 adversaire par touche de plus que la normale, dans les 10 m.","keys":["Burak Yılmaz ({T:away:bare}) : +0,96.","Ruben Vargas ({T:home:bare}) : +0,93.","Breel Embolo ({T:home:bare}) : +0,82.","À l'autre bout, Mert Müldür (−0,41) a joué dans un relatif anonymat : parfois, c'est exactement ce qu'on cherche."],"impact":"Et l'attention était méritée : Hakan Çalhanoğlu a quand même pesé sur le score (1 but(s) ou passe(s) décisive(s)). Le marquer, c'était nécessaire ; ce n'était pas suffisant."},"en":{"lead":"Hakan Çalhanoğlu had a fan club, wearing the other shirt: 1.13 extra opponents per touch within 10 m.","keys":["Burak Yılmaz ({T:away:sub}): +0.96.","Ruben Vargas ({T:home:sub}): +0.93.","Breel Embolo ({T:home:sub}): +0.82.","At the other end, Mert Müldür (−0.41) played in relative peace: sometimes that is exactly the point."],"impact":"And the attention was deserved: Hakan Çalhanoğlu still weighed on the scoreline (1 goal(s) or assist(s)). Marking him was necessary, not sufficient."}},"s7":{"fr":{"lead":"Menace créée balle au pied et à la passe (xT) : 2,21 pour {T:home:sub}, 0,85 pour {T:away:sub}. Le meilleur créateur : Remo Freuler, 0,44 xT à lui seul (20 % de la menace de son équipe).","keys":["Geste le plus menaçant {T:home:de} : une passe signée Remo Freuler à la 65e minute (+0,33 xT).","Geste le plus menaçant {T:away:de} : une passe signée Yusuf Yazıcı à la 94e minute (+0,13 xT)."],"impact":"La menace a payé : {T:home:sub} a fait avancer le ballon plus dangereusement, et le score a suivi."},"en":{"lead":"Threat created by passes and carries (xT): 2.21 for {T:home:sub}, 0.85 for {T:away:sub}. Top creator: Remo Freuler, 0.44 xT on his own (20% of his team's threat).","keys":["{T:home:pos} most dangerous action: a pass by Remo Freuler in minute 65 (+0.33 xT).","{T:away:pos} most dangerous action: a pass by Yusuf Yazıcı in minute 94 (+0.13 xT)."],"impact":"Threat paid off: {T:home:sub} moved the ball more dangerously, and the score followed."}},"s8":{"fr":{"lead":"Sur l'ensemble de la compétition, Kevin Mbabu pointe au 2e rang des latéraux (sur 78). Ce match, c'était aussi une vitrine.","keys":["Granit Xhaka ({T:home:bare}) : 6e des milieux sur 80.","Ricardo Rodríguez ({T:home:bare}) : 9e des latéraux sur 78.","Yann Sommer ({T:home:bare}) : 4e des gardiens sur 24.","Joueurs dans le top 5 de leur poste : 2 pour {T:home:sub}, 0 pour {T:away:sub}."],"impact":"La hiérarchie a été respectée : {T:home:sub} alignait plus de joueurs au sommet de leur poste, et ça s'est vu."},"en":{"lead":"Across the whole competition, Kevin Mbabu ranks 2nd among full-backs (out of 78). This match was also a showcase.","keys":["Granit Xhaka ({T:home:sub}): 6th of 80 midfielders.","Ricardo Rodríguez ({T:home:sub}): 9th of 78 full-backs.","Yann Sommer ({T:home:sub}): 4th of 24 goalkeepers.","Players in their position's top 5: 2 for {T:home:sub}, 0 for {T:away:sub}."],"impact":"The pecking order held: {T:home:sub} fielded more players at the top of their position, and it showed."}},"s9":{"fr":{"lead":"Jumeau statistique pour Xherdan Shaqiri : Thomas Müller ({TN:Bayern Munich}, finales de Ligue des champions), similaire à 91 %. Mêmes habitudes, autre maillot.","keys":["Caglar Söyüncü ↔ Stefan de Vrij (Euro 2024, 96 %).","Nico Elvedi ↔ E. Khacheridi (Euro 2016, 96 %).","Haris Seferović ↔ H. Seferović (Euro 2016, 95 %)."],"impact":"Un jumeau n'est pas un clone : la similarité compare des profils par 90 minutes (tirs, passes, xT, défense…), pas le talent. Mais ça donne des idées au mercato."},"en":{"lead":"Xherdan Shaqiri's statistical twin? Thomas Müller ({TN:Bayern Munich}, Champions League finals), 91% similar. Same habits, different shirt.","keys":["Caglar Söyüncü ↔ Stefan de Vrij (Euro 2024, 96%).","Nico Elvedi ↔ E. Khacheridi (Euro 2016, 96%).","Haris Seferović ↔ H. Seferović (Euro 2016, 95%)."],"impact":"A twin is not a clone: similarity compares per-90 profiles (shots, passes, xT, defending…), not talent. Still, it gives transfer ideas."}}}}